<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Portal Pelanggan — <%= companyName %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #0f172a;
      color: #f8fafc;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 16px;
    }
    .card {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
      background: #1e293b;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .logo-wrap {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .logo-img {
      max-height: 52px;
      max-width: 140px;
      object-fit: contain;
    }
    .logo-icon {
      font-size: 40px;
      color: #38bdf8;
    }
    .company-title {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #f8fafc;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .5px;
    }
    .badge-sub {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0284c7;
      background: #082f49;
      border: 1px solid #0369a1;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }
    .desc {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin: 16px 0 20px 0;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .btn-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .btn {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      width: 100%;
      padding: 13px 16px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all .15s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      border: none;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: #0284c7;
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.4);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: #0369a1; }
    .btn-success {
      background: #059669;
      color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.4);
    }
    .btn-success:hover { background: #047857; }
    .btn-outline {
      background: #0f172a;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }
    .btn-outline:hover { background: #1e293b; color: #ffffff; }
    .info-box {
      margin-top: 22px;
      background: #0f172a;
      border: 1px solid #334155;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .info-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 8px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
    .info-item i {
      font-size: 14px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .footer-cs {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    .footer-cs a {
      color: #38bdf8;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="logo-wrap">
      <% if (settings.company_logo) { %>
        <img src="<%= settings.company_logo %>" class="logo-img" alt="Logo" />
      <% } else { %>
        <i class="bi bi-wifi logo-icon"></i>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="company-title"><%= companyName %></div>
    <div><span class="badge-sub">Koneksi Resmi Modem Pelanggan</span></div>

    <% if (cid) { %>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;padding:6px 12px;background:#082f49;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#38bdf8">
        ID Pelanggan: <strong><%= cid %></strong>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <div class="desc">
      Terima kasih telah menggunakan layanan internet kami. Silakan gunakan tombol di bawah ini untuk mengakses akun dan layanan Anda:
    </div>

    <div class="btn-group">
      <a href="/downloads/billing-rtrw.apk" class="btn btn-success">
        <i class="bi bi-download"></i> Unduh Aplikasi Pelanggan (APK)
      </a>

      <a href="/customer/login<%= cid ? ('?cid=' + encodeURIComponent(cid)) : '' %>" class="btn btn-primary">
        <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right"></i> Masuk ke Portal Web Pelanggan
      </a>

      <% if (companyPhone) { %>
        <a href="https://wa.me/<%= companyPhone.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '') %>" target="_blank" class="btn btn-outline">
          <i class="bi bi-whatsapp" style="color:#10b981"></i> Hubungi Bantuan CS WhatsApp
        </a>
      <% } %>
    </div>

    <div class="info-box">
      <div class="info-item">
        <i class="bi bi-lightning-charge-fill" style="color:#f59e0b"></i>
        <div><strong>Waspada Petir:</strong> Cabut adaptor daya & kabel saat hujan lebat demi keselamatan modem Anda.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="info-item">
        <i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat" style="color:#38bdf8"></i>
        <div><strong>Cara Reboot:</strong> Matikan tombol power modem 10 detik lalu nyalakan kembali jika koneksi melambat.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-cs">
      <%= settings.company_address || '' %>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>